# codebase-memory-mcp whole-repo index — DERIVED data, regenerated from source by
# `index_repository`. The repo-root graph is ~17 MB of incompressible zstd (31.5k nodes /
# 138.7k edges) and is rewritten on every re-index, so tracking it would add ~17 MB of
# undeltifiable blob to history per index run. The tool's own .gitattributes (merge=ours)
# solves conflicts, not bloat. The much smaller browser_agent_extension/ index stays
# tracked. To version this one instead, delete these two lines and `git add -f`.
/.codebase-memory/

